# Serviço Node: use ADC no ambiente; não coloque credenciais no repositório.
PORT=8788
MEDIA_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace-with-a-long-random-secret
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-project
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/run/secrets/google-credentials.json
# Worker: configure com `wrangler secret put NOME`:
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID, R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, MEDIA_SERVICE_TOKEN
# PAYOUT_KEY_ENCRYPTION_KEY: 32 bytes aleatórios em base64 (somente no Worker).
# Aire Photos — secrets do Worker:
# FACE_EMBEDDINGS_TOKEN, FACE_INDEX_ENCRYPTION_KEY (32 bytes base64), FACE_IP_HASH_SECRET (32+ caracteres)
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN, WEBHOOK_SECRET ou ASAAS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN
# Vars: FACE_EMBEDDINGS_URL, FACE_MODEL_VERSION, FACE_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS,
# FACE_MEDIUM_THRESHOLD, FACE_HIGH_THRESHOLD (calibrados com o modelo facial escolhido).
# Vars Meta: WHATSAPP_GRAPH_VERSION, WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_NAME.
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL deve apontar à origem HTTPS real da Aire Photos.
